    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Intelligent Communication <span class="search-hit mathjax">Mixture</span>-of-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Experts</span> Boosted-Medical Image Segmentation Foundation Model
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
