    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Efficient High-Accuracy PDEs Solver with the Linear <span class="search-hit mathjax">Attention</span> Neural Operator
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhong%2C+M">Ming Zhong</a>, 
      
